	(text "01_APOLLO510B — SYSTEM MCU / FINAL SIGNAL ALLOCATION — REV A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 10 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.35 1.35)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0665d4a7-186f-47ca-86c9-191c3397c64b")
	)
	(text "Selected ZC-A1D43W-046 module specifies 3.3V QSPI and touch I/O. Apollo GPIO rails are 1.8V here, so level translation is mandatory. Keep 03_DISPLAY R301/R302 DNP because U106 block provides high-side I2C pull-ups."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 277.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "20f0cbcd-5d7f-406f-a1c3-d01e97de10c0")
	)
	(text "32.768kHz crystal is kept for accurate RTC/timekeeping; exact crystal + load caps are selected in BOM/footprint pass. 48MHz BLE crystal uses on-chip tuning; no external load caps shown."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 285.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "28a27065-c48c-451f-8116-8174d37930fc")
	)
	(text "DISPLAY + TOUCH LEVEL TRANSLATION — REQUIRED: APOLLO GPIO=1.8V, SELECTED MODULE I/O=3.3V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245 158 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.85 0.85)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3658c48a-5560-486e-82f7-f2813e3b9d52")
	)
	(text "Native KiCad ERC must be run after final hierarchical export because child-sheet labels are not cross-sheet connections yet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 291.2 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4a937a92-b876-4804-be05-adf1cab51812")
	)
	(text "POWER / SIMO / CLOCK SUPPORT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "57f43706-bc2c-4b3b-a0d5-6affd717aa97")
	)
	(text "BLE CONTROLLER — VOLTAGE MULTIPLIER MODE @ 1.8V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245 92 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6dfe1f29-90ea-4f26-b7c9-1d5d610bd0b7")
	)
	(text "GPIO15/J5 is internally used as BLE reference clock and is NC. RESERVED balls H8/H9/J8/J9/M7/M8 are NC. USB data/MIPI pads are NC; unused USB/MIPI supply rails are grounded per Ambiq guidance."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 280 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6f6b57f1-0598-44e3-9e8c-516132526fbf")
	)
	(text "BLE controller is voltage-multiplier mode: A7 BLE_SW_DCDC grounded; VIO/VBAT2/VCC=1.8V; A8 VBAT1 has 2.2uF. This avoids a second BLE DCDC inductor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 282.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "74633756-9b9e-4d04-990c-bed50a489b49")
	)
	(text "Wi-Fi uses MSPI0 GPIO64-73 plus GPIO199 CS; all on 1.8V VDDH3 domain. nRF7002 IOVDD is also 1.8V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 268.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "7bee3093-7262-48d8-b9fc-66525cc6065a")
	)
	(text "Display uses dedicated DISP_QSPI functions on GPIO100-104, GPIO83 reset, GPIO50 TE, GPIO99 CS (GPIO), GPIO98 VCI_EN. GPIO96 controls U103 OE; GPIO95 controls U102 OE."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 271.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8e267edb-27cc-4eb5-bdae-fd4d1f27c9de")
	)
	(text "U101 pin map = exact AP510BFA-CBR 153-ball package. Gray/unpopulated package positions are omitted; RESERVED balls and GPIO15 are explicitly NC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 16 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.76 0.76)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9af3b151-dcfb-489f-b62c-3a3d645a9c1f")
	)
	(text "All VDDP/VDDA/VDDH rails are 1.8V. VDDH1-4 are also 1.8V so every unshifted peripheral bus is 1.8V. SYS_3V3 is only used on the display/touch side of translators."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 288.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "a0f442ae-c02f-4545-ae1e-e7f8bbf92c1d")
	)
	(text "CO5300 command reads return on QSPI SIO0. U103 is TXB0101 auto-direction; 1.8V-side max data rate is 60Mbps versus CO5300 max 50MHz QSPI write clock / 10MHz read clock."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 274.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ad9a4d73-648c-4160-ba68-0561dba57c1e")
	)
	(text "BLE_SW_DCDC is grounded in voltage-multiplier mode. BLE_VBAT2, BLE_VCC and BLE_VIO are all 1.8V; BLE_ENABLE E5 has the required ~10M pull-down."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245 119 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.62 0.62)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c2e29f15-e15c-4264-982f-d79f771221fb")
	)
	(text "R111 is the eMMC clock source terminator and belongs physically next to Apollo GPIO88; 22R is an initial SI value."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245 150 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.6 0.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c95a750b-af83-479b-80c4-c40ac8557573")
	)
	(text "PIN MUX: eMMC reserves SDIF0 GPIO84-88 + GPIO156-160; do not reassign. R111 is at Apollo end of CLK."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10 266 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.56 0.56)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "cdd59fde-f9e7-436b-b987-e6d5543d4470")
	)
	(text "C105=VDDP 10uF; C106=VDDA 1uF; C107=VDDH 2.2uF; C108=VDDH1 2.2uF; C109=VDDH2 2.2uF; C110=VDDH3 4.7uF; C111=VDDH4 100nF; C112=VDDAUDA 2.2uF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 245 83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.6 0.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "eafcbf14-4d78-4ea3-99a9-71d3d3b15d4b")
	)
